# (build 145) The item keeper's portrait (portrait 20, item_keeper) in the
# Central Tower's room (Building_CentralTowerRoom), from its picture: one
# of the twelve no route drew after build 142 (see paseo_hospital_picture).
# The way a player goes: the tower's desk, ROOM from "Where to?" (TO_CHOSEN:
# building 9, portrait $14), the keeper's greeting and menu, B, "take
# care", and out to the street.

start building 8 21 0 0 32 16       # the desk; the street is 32,16
wait idle
expect menu $35                     # ROOM / LIBRARY / OUTSIDE
press c
wait idle
expect script $0E01                 # "How're you doing?"
expect picture 56 64 item_keeper
shot 01_item_keeper
press c
wait idle
expect menu $38
press b
wait idle
expect script $0E08                 # "Well, then, take care!"
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 4 32 16
expect picture 56 64 none
expect no-stderr not ported
